		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=529#comment-9530</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[A brief chat - sounds so fleeting - and yet your dazzling eyes and delightful smile spoke deeply of a brilliant soul.  You gently reached out to gather hold and get a better view of the charms round my neck - i usually would NOT allow anyone that much room on such short notice - but your energy &amp; presence assured me it was alright.  Briefly &amp; peripherally i was brought into your closer circle by way of the &quot;share a mom program&quot; - i have every installment.  May your spirit &amp; energy continue to flow &amp; dance.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>A brief chat &#8211; sounds so fleeting &#8211; and yet your dazzling eyes and delightful smile spoke deeply of a brilliant soul.  You gently reached out to gather hold and get a better view of the charms round my neck &#8211; i usually would NOT allow anyone that much room on such short notice &#8211; but your energy &amp; presence assured me it was alright.  Briefly &amp; peripherally i was brought into your closer circle by way of the &#8220;share a mom program&#8221; &#8211; i have every installment.  May your spirit &amp; energy continue to flow &amp; dance.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
